# Do NOT ignore genuine final model artifacts -- they are the deliverable
# the running app actually loads. models/, artifacts/, data/processed/*_enriched.parquet
# and results/*.json are intentionally tracked via Git LFS (see .gitattributes).

# Redundant, purely duplicate copies of what's already tracked above
# (raw per-epoch BERT checkpoints not used by any production code path,
# plus duplicate notebooks/outputs) -- preserved locally on disk, not pushed
# to keep the repo/LFS quota usable. Ask to include if you really want it in git.
original_project_backup/

